[[Captain]] '''Brander Lawson''' was a [[human]] who lived in [[the galaxy]] during the [[Imperial Era]].<ref name="Reveal" /> During or after [[19 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{ShadowofMaulDate|1}}</ref> Lawson along with his partner, [[2B0T|Two-Boots]], were attempting to investigate lawless dealings occurring on the [[planet]] [[Janix]] that were connected to the renegade [[Sith]] criminal [[Maul]].<ref name="Reveal" />

